# Copy thanh frontend/.env neu can build ban dong goi. Vite nhung cac bien VITE_*
# vao bundle luc build, nen day la gia tri bi "dong cung" — khong doi duoc sau khi build.
# CI cung doc bien nay tu process.env (workflow "Packages", input api_url).

# Dia chi FastAPI, khong co dau / o cuoi.
#   - Chay trinh duyet (dev/prod sau reverse proxy): DE TRONG.
#     Dev nho proxy trong vite.config.ts, prod nho cung origin.
#   - Ban dong goi: BAT BUOC dat, vi Electron (file://), iOS (capacitor://) va
#     Android (https://localhost cua WebView) deu khong cung origin voi API,
#     nen duong dan tuong doi /api se khong toi duoc backend.
#
# Neu de trong, src/lib/config.ts van tu suy ra mot gia tri de ban chay thu duoc:
#   - Electron / iOS simulator -> http://localhost:8080  (chung mang voi may chay app)
#   - Android emulator         -> http://10.0.2.2:8080    (alias cua emulator tro ve may host)
#   - Android may that         -> khong suy ra duoc, PHAI dat bien nay.
#
# RIENG ANDROID, ban phat hanh BAT BUOC dung https://. WebView chay o origin
# https://localhost (androidScheme: https) nen moi request http:// deu la "mixed content"
# va bi Android chan; targetSdk 33 con chan cleartext o tang network. Mo khoa
# android.allowMixedContent thi duoc, nhung Capacitor ghi ro la chi danh cho dev —
# dung dua vao ban phat hanh.
VITE_API_URL=http://localhost:8080
